s="dashed"/><div class="section-title">byWaiterTitle</div><div class="row"><span>Camila (18)</span><span class="right">$ 900,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>· thCash</span><span class="right">$ 200,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>· thTip</span><span class="right">$ 70,000</span></div><div class="row"><span></span><span class="right">waiterReturned($ 5,000)</span></div><div class="row"><span>Cliente (13)</span><span class="right">$ 623,400</span></div><div class="row"><span>· thCash</span><span class="right">$ 187,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>· thTip</span><span class="right">$ 53,400</span></div></section><section><hr class="dashed"/><div class="section-title">cashAndCount</div><div class="row"><span>baseInitial</span><span class="right">$ 200,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>cashReceived</span><span class="right">$ 387,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>changeGiven</span><span class="right">$ 12,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>expectedInDrawer</span><span class="right">$ 587,000</span></div><div class="row"><span>declaredAtClose</span><span class="right">$ 585,000</span></div><div class="row grand"><span>difference</span><span class="right">-$ 2,000</span></div><p class="note">notes:</p><p class="note">Faltaron 2.000 en monedas</p><p class="note">Se cambió el rollo de la caja</p></section><hr class="dashed"/><div class="footer"><div>reportGenerated</div></div></article>"`;

